            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ungafisi umfazi womakhelwane wakho, ungafisi indlu yomakhelwane wakho, nezwe lakhe, nenceku yakhe, nencekukazi yakhe, nenkabi yakhe, nembongolo yakhe, nokunye okomakhelwane wakho.",
