            "sid": "DEU 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi nathi: Bhekani, uJehova uNkulunkulu wethu usesenze sabona inkazimulo yakhe nobukhulu bakhe, futhi sizwile izwi lakhe livela emlilweni; sibonile namuhla ukuthi uNkulunkulu ukhuluma nomuntu, aphile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
