          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sondela uzwe konke uJehova uNkulunkulu wethu azakutsho; ukhulume kithi konke uJehova uNkulunkulu wethu ayakukukhuluma kuwe; futhi siyakuzwa, sikwenze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
